# Hive of the Eye Tyrant is the first land, so it enters untapped (one other land would not matter, none is here). Bot1 puts a
# Shock in its own graveyard; Bot2 puts a Lotus Petal and two Lightning Bolts in theirs. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {3}{B} with four
# Moxen and Hive becomes a 3/3 black Beholder land creature with menace until end of turn (CR 613.1d, 613.1e, 613.4b).
# Attacking, its trigger may not target Bot1's own Shock (only "defending player's graveyard", CR 508.5) and exiles Bot2's Lotus
# Petal, an artifact card ("target card" is any card, not only an instant). The animation is gone on turn 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Hive of the Eye Tyrant
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Shock
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lotus Petal
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

